DCE8 B7C008           (    forth6809.asm):01545                     STA   ACIACR
DCEB 12               (    forth6809.asm):01546                     NOP                     ; Settling Delay
DCEC 12               (    forth6809.asm):01547                     NOP
                      (    forth6809.asm):01548         
